    <introduction>
      <para>Thank you for choosing DemiCode Scheduler as the scheduling component for your applications.</para>
      <para>This Help system describes the DemiCode Scheduler component.</para>
    </introduction>

	

	<section>
	<title>In this section</title>
            <content>
                <definitionTable>
                    <definedTerm><link xlink:href="d89af9ef-56cd-4dd7-bc4e-db4f236357f4" /></definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            Provides an introduction to the DemiCode Scheduler component by describing how
                            the product works and defining its main operations.</para>
                    </definition>
                    <definedTerm><link xlink:href="f3e5c0d1-beec-42fe-859a-2331662441bf" /></definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            This section describes how to begin using DemiCode Scheduler.</para>
                    </definition>
                    <definedTerm><link xlink:href="ac8cf6b9-a48f-4b86-b13d-2303a63255aa" /></definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            Sample code snippets and walkthroughs of the provided samples.
                        </para>
                    </definition>
                    <definedTerm><link xlink:href="d9a6a49a-098b-4d25-aa79-eb78b4634e34" /></definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            Describes how to configure the scheduler using the .config file and/or XML.</para>
                    </definition>
                    <definedTerm>
                    	<externalLink>
                    		<linkText>Class library reference</linkText>
    						<linkUri>R_Project.htm</linkUri>
    						<linkTarget>_self</linkTarget>
						</externalLink>
					</definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            This section describes all public classes, methods and properties that make up the
                            DemiCode Scheduler component.</para>
                    </definition>
                    <definedTerm><link xlink:href="487cf5db-4b22-4ca2-b7ef-4d1254f06eab" /></definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            Provides information on creating custom tasks and schedules.
                        </para>
                    </definition>
                    <definedTerm><link xlink:href="27d2bee2-065b-489b-ac2e-e3b9106b5325">Debugging</link></definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            How to diagnose errors in the DemiCode Scheduler and custom tasks.
                        </para>
                    </definition>
                    <definedTerm><link xlink:href="0de6046f-c5e3-4dc8-abd8-1b9a8d7d68c7" /></definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            How to deploy DemiCode Scheduler runtime components with your application.
                        </para>
                    </definition>
                    <definedTerm><link xlink:href="6f6e0381-6914-4357-a53f-915dff7e0305" /></definedTerm>
                    <definition>
                        <para>
                            How to reach us.
                        </para>
                    </definition>
                </definitionTable>
		</content>            
	</section>            
            

